OL,3,APope pictured for first time since
OL,4,Asurgery and cancer diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV has been pictured
OL,7,Fcelebrating Mass from hospital, in the
OL,8,Ffirst images of him released by the
OL,9,FVatican since he underwent lung
OL,10,Fsurgery.
OL,12,FThe 71-year-old pontiff was diagnosed
OL,13,Fwith lung cancer after the surgery at
OL,14,FRome's Gemelli Hospital on Tuesday
OL,15,Fafternoon, which the Vatican said had
OL,16,Fbeen "successful" and proceeded without
OL,17,Fcomplications.
OL,19,FThe images shared on Friday showed the
OL,20,FChicago-born Pope wearing a green robe
OL,21,Fwhile standing behind a makeshift altar
OL,22,Fon the tenth floor of the hospital.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
